alidation within the supplied split establishes reproducibility but not causality, mechanism, or external generalizability. Some rare categorical contrasts remain unresolved because cell counts are insufficient, and several deferred low-priority claims are untested, but none currently suggests a second meaningful association.\\n\\nMost informative next analysis: the highest-value next step is diagnostic and external. In the supplied dataset, broad additional predictor scans are unlikely to be efficient because the feature_050-outcome_001 signal already dominates outcome_001 and most alternative panels have failed. If more in-dataset work is needed, closure-only tests of remaining low-priority claims are reasonable, but only if the lower confidence bound exceeds the relevant 10% absolute-mean threshold. Overall, the decisive next analysis is to determine whether feature_050 encodes outcome_001 pipeline structure, cell-line/sample identity, batch, assay quality, or a biological proxy, and to replicate the accepted association in independent biological or metadata-linked data.",
